{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13530","headline":"古塞曲 · 王季友","name":"古塞曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"进军飞狐北，穷寇势将变。\n日落沙尘昏，背河更一战。\n騂马黄金勒，雕弓白羽箭。\n射杀左贤王，归奏未央殿。\n欲言塞下事，天子不召见。\n东出咸阳门，哀哀泪如霰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王季友","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13530.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13530","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}